DESCRIPTION:Join us for a morning of imagination and creativity! Miss Marie\, the Children&#8217\;s Education Manager\, will read a nature-themed book\, sing songs\, and lead a craft activity related to the book of the week.\nThe Ruth Bancroft Garden is not only an extraordinary living museum of plants but also a place where imaginations bloom. We believe in fostering a deep connection between children and nature\,  https://www.ruthbancroftgarden.org/event/story-time-11-19/
URL:https://www.ruthbancroftgarden.org/event/story-time-11-19/
